@flexiarg ways-of-working/real-users
@title The work has real users, and we can say who
@keywords way of working, invariant, cascade live
@audience agents, operators, institution designers
@tone normative
@style pattern
@status draft 2026-11-02 by claude-16; runs correct it
@provenance declared in futon3c/holes/excursions/ways-of-working.json (claude-2 with Joe, 2026-11-02)
@why [creativity-commons/benefit-proportional-to-contribution creativity-commons/affected-participants-change-the-rules]

! conclusion: Each population holds a dated, sourced value on the scale none, asked, tried, uses, depends, with hops from the source recorded as a plain fact.

  + IF:
    A community is a claim until it names a population: a thing used by people, known at a date, from a source that is not our own say-so.

  + HOWEVER:
    Building feels like progress, and a population is easy to assume. Friends, collaborators and past successes can be counted as evidence that a new thing transfers.

  + THEN:
    Each population holds a dated, sourced value on the scale none, asked, tried, uses, depends, with hops from the source recorded as a plain fact.

  + BECAUSE:
    Work justified by who benefits stands whoever funds it. Moving between funders fixes a venue failure only, not a who-benefits failure. Something carries when it holds without the introducer and goes on to people they bring.

  + VALIDATION:
    For each population, what is the value, at what date, on whose evidence, and does it hold without the introducer?
